    "detailed_description": "In this action dungeon-crawling RPG experience, you take on the role of a fighter: Explore and travel through the lands and surrounding countries of Lestoria in search of adventure! <br><br>Your quest begins in search of slimes in a nearby forest to restock on potion-making supplies, to soon discover that bandits have attacked the locals and have caused hysteria and chaos. Who would do such an awful thing, and can you put an end to their crimes?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore landscapes filled with monsters and items!</h2>The resources from nature will come in handy, make sure to collect them all.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/13b00d3812133c613bdf98c404f70ea8.poster.avif?t=1739991409\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/13b00d3812133c613bdf98c404f70ea8.webm?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/13b00d3812133c613bdf98c404f70ea8.mp4?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose From 6 Unique Classes to play!</h2>Each class has their own fighting style and movement.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/0747bdb1f88e7809e5168498b2c59c24.poster.avif?t=1739991409\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/0747bdb1f88e7809e5168498b2c59c24.webm?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/0747bdb1f88e7809e5168498b2c59c24.mp4?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Items, Craft, and Upgrade Your Equipment</h2>The locals will help you on your journey, giving you access to the finest gear an Adventurer could get their hands on.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/82c0bbf334e30eea48b18ad4907500a6.poster.avif?t=1739991409\" width=320 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/82c0bbf334e30eea48b18ad4907500a6.webm?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/82c0bbf334e30eea48b18ad4907500a6.mp4?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Learn and Inquire About the Townsfolk</h2>As you become stronger, more folks will be seeking your services.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/9c2c21a44c14502ad788f09f414bf8cb.poster.avif?t=1739991409\" width=320 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/9c2c21a44c14502ad788f09f414bf8cb.webm?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2894970/extras/9c2c21a44c14502ad788f09f414bf8cb.mp4?t=1739991409\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
